  "request": "Issue #433: Preserve unrelated preparing flows between init and prepare. Remove global time-based unrelated preparing-run deletion. flow set init never deletes existing preparing runs. Successful flow prepare --run-id X deletes only X after successful conversion; failed prepare preserves X and all unrelated runs. Preserve unrelated records byte-identically regardless of age, and replace obsolete TTL/61-minute assumptions with preservation and failure-atomicity tests. Keep existing store ownership boundaries and public behavior otherwise unchanged. Do not add cleanup/archive, reconstruct or replace lost #415, add dependencies or compatibility shims, or change unrelated lifecycle behavior.",
